{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21391","headline":"赋得春雪映早梅 · 元稹","name":"赋得春雪映早梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞舞先春雪，因依上番梅。\n一枝方渐秀，六出已同开。\n积素光逾密，真花节暗催。\n抟风飘不散，见晛忽偏摧。\n郢曲琴空奏，羌音笛自哀。\n今朝两成咏，翻挟昔人才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}